{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/400617-who-wants-hunter-the-book-of-judges-as-a-future-historical-supplement","id":400617,"title":"Who wants Hunter: The Book of Judges, as a future historical supplement?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-10T12:01:06-08:00","id":400617,"title":"Who wants Hunter: The Book of Judges, as a future historical supplement?","content":"I liked the idea and think it would make for a great future Dark Era Supplement. Who is with me. Lets get a petition started<br /> <br /> I feel it would be kinda like Exalted Lite in the World of Darkness","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly","name":"maryshelly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T17:43:53-08:00","id":401093,"title":"","content":"It looks like it won't make the book, but Book of Judges seems like such a cool era for Hunter. I definitely hope we get to see this supplement in some form","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T18:25:11-08:00","id":401200,"title":"","content":"Eras that lost might show up again in future polls; I think they mentioned that.<br /> <br /> As much as I would love this Era (if only for Demon crossover), I doubt petitioning would do much other than make everyone involved look silly. Go vote with your wallet instead - go buy Hunter pdfs, especially Mortal Remains - and see if that catches the higher ups' attention.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T00:11:54-08:00","id":401536,"title":"","content":"I definitely want Book of Judges Hunter (though I voted for Ottoman Demon)! Part of me even thinks it lagging in the poll is simply reflecting the inherent problem of 3 option, plurality win voting. I'd bet good money with a ranked voting system (which you really need if you're going to have more than two options where plurality wins), it would win via a tonage of second-choice votes it would get.<br /> <br /> For whatever it's worth, in my &quot;Vigil for Rome&quot; notes (contemporary to Requiem for Rome in the 4th Century), I made the Shoftim (Judges) an important Compact, protecting the Children of Israel as they are gradually dispersed further and further from their homeland. They may once have been a Conspiracy wielding Holy Psalms (ala Benedictions, but more Tanakh/King David-y), but if so these were lost when the Second Temple fell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"li